bels\",\n+      \"intent\": \"A trailing unpaired escape invalidates the whole input after valid and duplicate labels.\",\n+      \"input\": \"OK,ok,NEXT,\\\\\",\n+      \"expected\": null\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"trailing_escape_inside_quote\",\n+      \"intent\": \"A trailing escape inside quoted mode invalidates the entire input after a valid label.\",\n+      \"input\": \"OK,\\\"NEXT\\\\\",\n+      \"expected\": null\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"unclosed_quote_after_valid_labels\",\n+      \"intent\": \"A quote opened midway through a later label invalidates the whole input despite valid preceding labels and embedded commas.\",\n+      \"input\": \"OK,NEXT,PRE\\\"TAIL,OTHER\",\n+      \"expected\": null\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"escaped_quote_does_not_close\",\n+      \"intent\": \"An escaped final quote stays literal and cannot close quoted mode after otherwise valid labels.\",\n+      \"input\": \"OK,\\\"NEXT\\\\\\\"\",\n+      \"expected\": null\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"properties\": [\"unique_nonempty_labels\", \"ascii_lowercase\"],\n+  \"rationale\": \"These 23 deterministic ASCII cases cover all ten rules and their interactions. Successful expectations follow left-to-right quote and escape handling, removal of quote delimiters, trimming only ordinary boundary whitespace, independent collapse of ordinary runs, exact preservation of protected whitespace, ASCII lowercasing, empty-result removal, and exact deduplication in first occurrence order. They exercise all six whitespace characters in ordinary, quoted, and escaped forms, protected boundaries and run breaks, empty quote concatenation, literal punctuation and controls, and equality across protection provenance. Four invalid suffix cases require whole-input ValueError even after valid labels. No Unicode or non-string behavior is tested.\"\n+}\n",
